---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getEmailFormUrl } from '../config/subscriptions';
const formUrl = getEmailFormUrl();
---

<Layout title="订阅更新" description="通过邮件、RSS 或微信公众号，继续阅读为何是祂的文章。" lang="zh" path="/subscribe/">
  <div class="container subscription-page">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">REASON FOR HIM · 保持联系</p>
      <h1>让下一篇文章，与你相遇。</h1>
      <p class="intro">选择适合你的阅读方式。关于信仰、理性与生活的思考，我们慢慢读。</p>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="wechat-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / WECHAT</p>
      <h2 id="wechat-heading">微信公众号：为何是他</h2>
      <p>在微信中搜索公众号名称，或使用下方的公众号 ID。</p>
      <div class="wechat-id"><span>公众号 ID：<strong id="wechat-id">ReasonForHim</strong></span><button type="button" id="copy-wechat" hidden>复制公众号 ID</button></div>
      <p id="copy-status" class="note copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="rss-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">02 / RSS</p>
      <h2 id="rss-heading">在你的阅读器里相见</h2>
      <p>将订阅链接添加到你常用的 RSS 阅读器，即可查看新文章，无需留下邮箱。</p>
      <div class="channel-links"><a href="/zh/rss.xml">中文 RSS ↗</a><a href="/en/rss.xml" lang="en">English RSS ↗</a></div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="email-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / EMAIL</p>
      <h2 id="email-heading">邮件订阅</h2>
      {formUrl ? <>
        <p>收到新文章通知，在方便的时候阅读。提交后，请到邮箱点击确认链接；每封通知都提供退订入口。</p>
        <p class="note">表单由 Brevo 提供，邮箱及订阅记录由其管理，本站不保存邮箱。仅用于文章更新通知。</p>
        <p class="note">若表单未显示，请使用上方的微信公众号或 RSS。</p>
        <iframe src={formUrl} title="邮件订阅表单（Brevo）" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></iframe>
        <p class="note">你也可以<a href={formUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">在新窗口打开订阅表单 ↗</a>。</p>
      </> : <>
        <p>邮件订阅尚未开放。你可以先通过 RSS 或微信公众号关注更新。</p>
        <p class="note">开放后，需通过邮件确认订阅，并可随时退订。</p>
      </>}
    </section>

    <section id="home-screen" aria-labelledby="home-screen-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow" lang="en">04 / QUICK ACCESS</p>
      <h2 id="home-screen-heading">把这间书房留在手机桌面</h2>
      <p>无须订阅，也无须安装 App。将「为何是祂」添加到手机主屏幕，想阅读时，轻点图标即可回来。</p>
      <p class="note">桌面图标只是一条回来的捷径，不会提醒你新文章发布。若想收到更新，请使用上方的公众号、RSS 或邮件订阅。</p>

      <details>
        <summary>如何添加到手机桌面</summary>
        <div class="steps">
          <p>请先阅读以下步骤，再打开中文首页。手机会保存当前打开的页面，因此请在首页完成添加。</p>
          <p class="home-link"><a href="/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">打开中文首页 ↗</a><span>在新标签页打开 · reasonforhim.com/zh/</span></p>
          <h3>iPhone（Safari）</h3>
          <ol>
            <li>用 Safari 打开中文首页 reasonforhim.com/zh/。</li>
            <li>点地址栏旁的「···」，再点「共享」（分享按钮）。如果已看到方框加向上箭头的按钮，直接点它即可。</li>
            <li>在菜单中向下滑动，点「添加到主屏幕」。</li>
            <li>确认名称，点「添加」。</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="note">若看到「作为网页 App 打开」开关，开启后会在独立窗口中打开，关闭则在 Safari 中打开。</p>
          <p class="note">找不到「添加到主屏幕」？请确认使用的是 Safari。也可以滑到共享菜单底部，点「编辑操作」把它加回来。不同布局的按钮位置可能略有差异。</p>
          <h3>Android（Chrome）</h3>
          <ol>
            <li>用 Chrome 打开中文首页 reasonforhim.com/zh/。</li>
            <li>点右上角的「⋮」。</li>
            <li>在较新的版本中，点「安装并创建快捷方式」，再选「创建快捷方式」。较旧的版本中，这个选项叫「添加到主屏幕」。</li>
            <li>确认名称，点「添加」。</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="note">使用华为、小米、vivo、OPPO 等手机自带的浏览器，或使用夸克等浏览器时，请在菜单中寻找「添加到桌面」「发送到桌面」或相近的选项。</p>
          <p class="note">点了没有反应？部分手机需要先到系统「设置」里，为该浏览器开启「桌面快捷方式」权限。</p>
          <h3>从微信打开的读者</h3>
          <p>微信里通常无法直接添加到桌面。请在微信中打开中文首页，再点右上角的「···」，选择「在浏览器打开」（iPhone 上可能显示为「在 Safari 中打开」），然后按上面的步骤操作。</p>
          <p>如果没有这个选项，请复制首页网址 reasonforhim.com/zh/，粘贴到 Safari 或 Chrome 的地址栏中打开。仅在微信内点击首页链接，并不会自动切换到 Safari 或 Chrome。</p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <div id="home-screen-en" lang="en">
        <h3>Keep this reading room on your phone</h3>
        <p>No sign-up, no app to install. Add Reason for Him to your home screen, and you can come back with a single tap.</p>
        <p class="note">A home-screen icon brings you back here. It won’t tell you when new essays appear. For updates, use the RSS feed above.</p>
        <details>
          <summary>How to add it</summary>
          <div class="steps">
            <p>Read the steps below first, then open the English home page. Your phone saves the page currently open, so add the shortcut from the home page.</p>
            <p class="home-link"><a href="/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the English home page ↗</a><span>Opens in a new tab · reasonforhim.com/en/</span></p>
            <h4>iPhone (Safari)</h4>
            <ol>
              <li>Open reasonforhim.com/en/ in Safari.</li>
              <li>Tap the ··· button next to the address bar, then tap Share. If you see a Share button at the bottom of the screen, tap it directly.</li>
              <li>Scroll down and tap Add to Home Screen.</li>
              <li>Check the name and tap Add.</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="note">If you see an “Open as Web App” switch, leave it on to open the site in a separate window, or turn it off to open in Safari.</p>
            <h4>Android (Chrome)</h4>
            <ol>
              <li>Open reasonforhim.com/en/ in Chrome.</li>
              <li>Tap ⋮ in the top-right corner.</li>
              <li>Tap Install and create shortcut, then Create shortcut. In older versions, look for Add to Home screen.</li>
              <li>Tap Add.</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="note">Other browsers usually offer a similar “Add to Home screen” option in their menu.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  function openLinkedGuide() {
    const { hash } = location;
    if (hash === '#home-screen' || hash === '#home-screen-en') {
      const panel = document.querySelector<HTMLDetailsElement>(hash + ' > details');
      if (panel) panel.open = true;
    }
  }
  openLinkedGuide();
  window.addEventListener('hashchange', openLinkedGuide);
  // Following the footer link again after closing the panel doesn't change the hash.
  document.querySelector('footer a[href="/subscribe/#home-screen"]')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (location.hash === '#home-screen') openLinkedGuide();
  });

  const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#copy-wechat');
  const status = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#copy-status');
  if (button && status) {
    button.hidden = false;
    button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText('ReasonForHim');
        status.textContent = '已复制：ReasonForHim。打开微信搜索即可。';
      } catch {
        status.textContent = '未能自动复制，请长按或选中公众号 ID：ReasonForHim 手动复制。';
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .subscription-page { max-width: 800px; padding-block: 64px 80px; }
  header { margin-bottom: 40px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  h2 { font-size: 25px; }
  .intro { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; }
  section { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 30px; }
  section .eyebrow { color: var(--muted); }
  .note { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
  .channel-links, .wechat-id { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px 28px; align-items: center; }
  .channel-links a, .note a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  button { border: 1px solid var(--forest); background: transparent; color: var(--forest); border-radius: 2px; padding: 9px 16px; min-height: 44px; }
  button:hover { background: var(--paper); }
  strong { user-select: all; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .copy-status { min-height: 1.7em; margin: 14px 0 0; }
  iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: 650px; border: 0; background: white; margin-block: 20px; }
  #home-screen, #home-screen-en { scroll-margin-top: 20px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  #home-screen-en { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  #home-screen-en > h3 { font-size: 22px; }
  details { border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  summary { padding: 12px 4px; min-height: 44px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--forest); font-weight: 600; }
  summary::marker { color: var(--accent); }
  .steps { max-width: 68ch; padding-block: 4px 16px; }
  .steps h3, .steps h4 { margin: 24px 0 8px; font: 500 20px/1.5 var(--serif); }
  .steps ol { padding-inline-start: 1.6em; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .steps li + li { margin-top: 4px; }
  .steps p { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .home-link { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 0 16px; }
  .home-link a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .home-link span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .subscription-page { padding-block: 36px 48px; } }
</style>
